{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7f1ab55a2a867e4f10d482b20479eca1a551a216304f79ece2c77a4e1261073e", "ja": "（もうすぐ、魔法学園の撮影が始まる。\nみんなは毎日、お芝居の稽古中だ）", "zh": "（魔法学园的拍摄马上就要开始了。\n大家每天都在练习演戏）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "82f7f921719aca208ee238ac4c31c912b7315729b083cef550d3ffc07fd72355", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん、\nお疲れさまで～す。……えへっ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先～生，\n辛苦啦～。……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5e54916f40aa1d709376a3cd23241a6e64b85cece2e9fc55ed041272cfdb7ca6", "ja": "翼、お疲れ。\n今日の練習は、もう終わったのか？", "zh": "翼，辛苦了。今天的练习已经结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "905570ee36b53ab130ea038e6f7774c67369d9f53c97b9d4a46db3c21c1c661e", "ja": "はい、終わりました♪　それより～……\n{$P$}さん、何か感じませんか？", "zh": "是的，已经结束了♪　比起这个～……\n{$P$}先生，你没感觉到什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d28c38cb0003feed55b6e353a687e75187104176a3c4d0800b0f2c7a9da83b7a", "ja": "？　何かって？", "zh": "？什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "82ca675508cd8e6b8b5b81b5c086b75c2aea3567b13e94cde8bdc232d21c73ca", "ja": "え、気づいてないんですか？　ホントに？", "zh": "诶，你真的没注意到吗？真的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4c91c920559c5edcb96d06d7cb30aac98cd3275a5469c22acf2f0f5f4b73c6f8", "ja": "も～、ちゃんと考えてくださいよ～。\nそしたら、何か気がつくかも？", "zh": "真是的～，好好想想嘛～。\n这样的话，说不定就能发现什么哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7091fad0122de0eeafc7cfd7d112d6bce62ab7dde51e06763fa53d93a464b96c", "ja": "そう言われてもな。うーん……\nもしかして、練習中に何かあったのか？", "zh": "你这么说也没办法啊。嗯……\n难道是练习的时候发生了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b7807f8d51e25f612c653270be090bfa4a8ae86778d51870fbe3ffe78930ccda", "ja": "も～、違います！　{$P$}さんに\nわたしの魔法、全然効いてない～！", "zh": "真是的～，不是那样！我的魔法对{$P$}先生完全不起作用～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1009_p", "source_sha256": "bf2c04499266c6f924ae920727dbb2302a569a5f14401df3612a1c09159e29a5", "ja": "魔法……？", "zh": "魔法……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2467db1a983928ca6fe17731349c792905214fabe3afd0559154704f8833b318", "ja": "魔法です！　お芝居の設定の中に、\nすっごく素敵な魔法があったんですよ～。", "zh": "是魔法！在剧本设定里，有一种特别特别棒的魔法哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b4642c8a02f51eb8193f4c86e8929982d3d11a3a0cb4585d825651fc649e0d1c", "ja": "だから、{$P$}さんにかけて\nみたのに……気づいてもくれないなんて……。", "zh": "所以我明明试着对{$P$}先生施展了……你居然连察觉都没有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1012_p", "source_sha256": "26bd95fd6955fd09a745ec7fa3f66d3971a6fc7fe697be27c3a092a2793ea1d9", "ja": "そ、そうか……。翼が俺にかけた魔法は、\nすぐに効果が出るようなものなのか？", "zh": "这、这样啊……翼对我施展的魔法，是那种能立刻生效的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6272bc2270e3d6b78658f7ad5d46054bcec678479696fc8ec62e13278571e37f", "ja": "えっ？　そういえば……\nそこまでは、書いてなかったかも。", "zh": "诶？这么说来……\n好像没写到那么详细。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ef894c0927d07c7b078e1481f179f48ca39f2768beb7927330f810534281b78c", "ja": "だったら、この後徐々に効いてくるかもしれないな。\nもう少し様子を見てみたらどうだ？", "zh": "既然这样，接下来或许会慢慢生效。要不要再观察一阵子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8171abe175d1b278a9c5ac8a9d202fe61479cd44e26106a894f38a8305beb730", "ja": "でも{$P$}さん、魔法に\n気づいてなかったんですよね？　大丈夫かな～？", "zh": "不过{$P$}先生，你当时没察觉到魔法，对吧？真的没问题吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8aa82572b6b9ec21cf72c2528b52ae545163121a07b6897d896e03941007b440", "ja": "じゃあ、ちょっとだけ、待ってあげますね。\nわたしがかけた魔法、効いてくれるといいんだけど。", "zh": "那么，我就稍微等您一下吧。\n希望我施下的魔法能对您生效。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0ce15c2b72806262f70d990a363ef64c8bc3ffb2bba2bc97e34bfd806a093456", "ja": "ところで……どんな魔法を俺にかけたんだ？", "zh": "话说回来……你对我施了什么魔法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d4aca27a12f1b73533fb24e707c42aadf29c56b758d211c99d6be4fe4d1c2b46", "ja": "それは、ヒミツで～す。", "zh": "这个嘛，是秘密～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1019_p", "source_sha256": "39b813398905e70b0f28cf0d8592b5611ef4d35bc09a41ea5eac8d8f3722ab7a", "ja": "でも、どうなるか知っておかないと……\n魔法が効いてきたかどうか、翼に報告できないだろ？", "zh": "不过，要是不先知道会变成什么样……就没法向翼报告魔法到底有没有生效吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "11ace132bc1401ce40f01b32046ed587a91200c6033763c201d5857349b87d52", "ja": "う～ん……それじゃあ、今度教えます♪　それまで、\nどんな魔法にかけられたか、考えててくださいね！", "zh": "嗯～……那我下次再告诉你♪在那之前，请先想想自己中了什么魔法吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0353_1021_p", "source_sha256": "bbcb5b9f99a11741be4c796c02cce7b265ed97ca57d0035642f719f84a33b0c5", "ja": "あ、翼！　……結構気になるんだけど、もしかして\nこれも翼の術中だったりするのか？　まさかな……。", "zh": "啊，翼！……我还真挺在意的，难道说这也是中了翼的魔法吗？不会吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
